+  # has kept our val_loss ~1.0 above the miners who train uninterrupted. The
+  # corpus is 4M rows per source, matching the 50/50 weights, pinned revisions.
+  #
+  # ORIGINAL UPSTREAM NOTE:
+  # `dataset_class` is deliberately NOT set. Leaving it unset resolves to
